00:11:39.767 --> 00:11:41.100
-Me?
-Yeah.

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:43.000
-That's right.
-It's a pleasure.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:44.133
-You guys -- You guys --

00:11:44.133 --> 00:11:45.801
You guys would so
like each other.

00:11:45.801 --> 00:11:47.567
