long and you've never even met.

00:11:47.567 --> 00:11:49.033
-I'm a big.

00:11:49.033 --> 00:11:52.234
-I mean, I'd love to sit down
and talk with you sometime.

00:11:52.234 --> 00:11:54.501
-You have been everywhere
doing press

00:11:54.501 --> 00:11:56.334
