00:11:56.334 --> 00:11:58.000
You must be exhausted.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.667
-It's -- It's pretty tiring.
Yeah.

00:11:59.667 --> 00:12:02.334
The last few weeks,
I've been to a lot of places.

00:12:02.334 --> 00:12:05.467
Started off going to Hong Kong.

00:12:05.467 --> 00:12:06.801
Was in Hong Kong,

00:12:06.801 --> 00:12:09.100
and then I flew to New York
and then L.A.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:14.067
And then L.A. to London
and then London back to New York

00:12:14.067 --> 00:12:17.234
and then Shanghai
and all within a few weeks.

00:12:17.234 --> 00:12:19.400
I've racked up a lot
of frequent flier miles,

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:22.701
but that's the nature
of the beast.

00:12:22.701 --> 00:12:25.133
-Do you like flying?
How is the flight to Hong Kong?

00:12:25.133 --> 00:12:26.601
-It's long. It's a long one.

00:12:26.601 --> 00:12:28.501
-It's a long one?
-But I don't mind it.

00:12:28.501 --> 00:12:31.200
I've done it twice.
I've been to Hong Kong twice.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:34.601
The first time I did it,
I fainted.

00:12:34.601 --> 00:12:36.901
I actually fainted.

00:12:36.901 --> 00:12:39.100
I had two bowls of soup.

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:42.834
And then I went to the bathroom.

00:12:42.834 --> 00:12:44.534
And as I was -- I was getting
ready to go to the bathroom.

00:12:44.534 --> 00:12:46.634
And I started feeling
really dizzy.

00:12:46.634 --> 00:12:49.634
And I remember there's a handle
and I went to reach for it.

00:12:49.634 --> 00:12:50.667
I was like, "Whoa."

00:12:50.667 --> 00:12:53.701
And then I just blacked out.

00:12:53.701 --> 00:12:56.267
And the next thing I knew,

00:12:56.267 --> 00:12:59.367
there was somebody
banging on the door

00:12:59.367 --> 00:13:04.167
and my right arm was completely
submerged in the toilet.

00:13:04.167 --> 00:13:05.467
[ Audience groans ]

00:13:05.467 --> 00:13:08.400
And my left hand
was around my penis.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:11.567
[ Laughter ]

00:13:11.567 --> 00:13:13.701
-Which is odd because normally
you hold your penis

00:13:13.701 --> 00:13:15.400
with your right hand.
-I know. Yeah.

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:17.300
-Your left hand's
normally in the toilet.

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:19.100
-That's exactly right.

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:20.567
I had to switch
with the handle.

00:13:20.567 --> 00:13:22.067
-Oh, that's what it was.

00:13:22.067 --> 00:13:25.200
-But that's how I found out
that I am allergic to MSG.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.868
-No way.

00:13:26.868 --> 00:13:29.767
So you really just fainted?
Oh, my gosh.

00:13:29.767 --> 00:13:31.367
-Yeah.
-Well, wow. That's amazing.

00:13:31.367 --> 00:13:34.968
I'm happy that you're here.

00:13:34.968 --> 00:13:36.834
I mean, it's amazing
that you didn't get hurt.

00:13:36.834 --> 00:13:38.934
-Amazing that I survived.
-No, exactly. Yeah.

00:13:38.934 --> 00:13:40.601
Good luck, man.
Okay. I'm drinking, right?

00:13:40.601 --> 00:13:42.501
-Okay, Jimmy,
you will drink this drink.

00:13:42.501 --> 00:13:45.267
-Okay. Come on.
Something good.

00:13:45.267 --> 00:13:47.801
-[ Laughing ]
Look, look.

00:13:47.801 --> 00:13:50.067
-No. Come on.

00:13:50.067 --> 00:13:52.200
-Oh!

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:53.934
