00:13:53.934 --> 00:13:55.934
-Not bad. Could be worse.
-That's alright.

00:13:55.934 --> 00:13:57.567
-Peppermint schnapps.

00:13:57.567 --> 00:14:00.367
Oh, sorry, Drinko.
-Oh, that's alright.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.901
Drink away.
