-Oh, that's pretty good.

00:17:43.767 --> 00:17:46.234
Yeah, that's pretty good.
Did you just sneeze?

00:17:46.234 --> 00:17:48.000
Paul, do you need a tissue?
Paul, here.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.167
-But, anyway, the Super Bowl,
it's gonna be a great --

00:17:50.167 --> 00:17:51.501
It's gonna be a really --

00:17:51.501 --> 00:17:53.234
-No, I know, it's gonna be
exciting, but --

00:17:53.234 --> 00:17:54.901
