I'll get it.

00:17:54.901 --> 00:17:56.033
-Wait.

00:17:56.033 --> 00:17:57.567
-Yeah, do it, right.

00:17:57.567 --> 00:17:58.667
Why don't you talk
about "Ant-Man"?

00:17:58.667 --> 00:18:00.200
-[ Sneezes ]
-Oh, God bless you.

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.367
God bless you.
-Okay. So, anyway --

00:18:02.367 --> 00:18:03.567
-No.

00:18:03.567 --> 00:18:07.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:18:07.501 --> 00:18:08.767
No, no, no, not that nose.

00:18:08.767 --> 00:18:11.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:18:11.033 --> 00:18:14.367
-The thing about "Ant-Man" is,

00:18:14.367 --> 00:18:17.000
you know, it's a serious film.

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.501
