-And, I mean, this is --

00:18:18.501 --> 00:18:19.767
it's different than the others.

00:18:19.767 --> 00:18:21.133
-Look at the clip over there.

00:18:21.133 --> 00:18:24.868
Maybe the clip is --
-The other "Ant-Man" films

00:18:24.868 --> 00:18:27.033
are kind of like
