00:18:27.033 --> 00:18:28.801
and then this one
is like just --

00:18:28.801 --> 00:18:29.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:18:29.934 --> 00:18:32.534
-This is, yeah.
Wow!

00:18:32.534 --> 00:18:33.901
[ Laughter and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:18:33.901 --> 00:18:36.067
Paul, Paul.

00:18:36.067 --> 00:18:37.400
-It's huge in scale.

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:40.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:18:40.367 --> 00:18:43.534
It's just absolutely huge
in scale.

00:18:43.534 --> 00:18:45.367
-Did you want some --
Paul, Paul.

00:18:45.367 --> 00:18:47.434
[ Laughter ]
Paul, here, here.

00:18:47.434 --> 00:18:49.033
Absolutely, yeah.
-Thank you very much.

00:18:49.033 --> 00:18:50.667
-Thank you for coming on.
