00:18:50.667 --> 00:18:54.267
[ Laughter ]
-Thank you very much.

00:18:54.267 --> 00:18:56.234
-You have a little
something over here. Yeah.

00:18:56.234 --> 00:18:57.567
The other side.
Thank you, yeah.

00:18:57.567 --> 00:18:58.601
-Did I get it?
-Yeah.

00:18:58.601 --> 00:18:59.834
-I'll get it, yeah.
I'll get it.

00:18:59.834 --> 00:19:02.100
There you go.
-Pfft!

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:04.000
[ Laughter ]
-Okay. Thank you.

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:05.834
I want to talk about this --
-People, by the way --

00:19:05.834 --> 00:19:08.234
